  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Climate &amp; Clean Air Coalition (CCAC) 2025 - Climate &amp; Clean Air Coalition (CCAC)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d till Climate &amp; Clean Air Coalition (CCAC) 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidrag till Climate &amp; Clean Air Coalition (CCAC), ett samarbete f&#xf6;r &#xf6;ka &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder som minskar klimatp&#xe5;verkande luftf&#xf6;roreningar, koldioxid och metan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Climate &amp; Clean Air Coalition (CCAC), a coalition to increase action in developing countries that reduces air pollution which also affects the climate such as carbon dioxide and methane.</narrative>
  </description>
